<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Movers To Chinnamanur Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I get an instant online estimate for moving my household goods to Chinnamanur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Visit our dedicated portal, enter your pickup and delivery addresses, select the inventory items, and choose any special services such as vehicle transport. The system instantly calculates the freight, packing, insurance, and GST components, providing a transparent quote for packers and movers to chinnamanur within minutes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for my goods during the 1499 km transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by 100% declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra charge. This protects against loss, theft, or damage from loading to unloading. You receive a detailed insurance certificate and can opt for additional coverage if desired.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide a GST‑compliant invoice for corporate or government reimbursements?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every move is billed with a GST‑registered invoice that includes our GSTIN, itemised charges, and e‑Way bill reference. This meets the documentation requirements of central and state government departments, PSUs, and corporate clients for seamless reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport my car along with household items on the same route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our fleet includes enclosed multi‑car trailers with hydraulic ramps and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Car shipping cost is calculated separately but can be bundled with the household move, ensuring a single point of contact and synchronized delivery to Chinnamanur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required at each checkpost along NH‑19?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You must present a valid ID, the original booking invoice, e‑Way bill, and insurance certificate. Our team ensures all paperwork is pre‑filled and ready for inspection, reducing delays at checkpoints and keeping the transit smooth for packers and movers to chinnamanur.</p>
      </div>
